    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The Cozy Nook: Designing for Jada\r\n\r\n**The User:** Jada owns \"The Purr-fect Page,\" a cat café and bookstore where customers can rent cozy reading nooks. She needs a booking system with a \"Cottagecore\" vibe.\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** Write a detailed prompt for AI Tutor to help you generate your web app layout. Your prompt must address the following three questions:\r\n\r\n> 1. What is the goal?\r\n> 2. What are the constraints?\r\n> 3. What are the edge cases?",
