            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "fontSize": 36,
            "fontFamily": 1,
            "text": "Design a cat cafe booking system app where there is live \ncount of \"napping\" vs. \"active\" cats, a list of available reading\nnooks, and a calendar for booking 1-hour sessions.\n\nUse a warm \"parchment\" colored background with soft brown \ntext and rounded, bubble-like buttons that look like cat paws \nto create a friendly, cutesy feel.\n\nIf the \"Cat-O-Meter\" shows all cats are napping, the app \nshould display a \"Shhh... Nap Time\" banner and suggest booking \na later slot for more interaction. If all the reading nooks are\nbooked, the app should show the next available time slot.",
            "textAlign": "center",
            "verticalAlign": "middle",
            "containerId": "rn5vZF917P3dmt5USPQev",
            "originalText": "Design a cat cafe booking system app where there is live count of \"napping\" vs. \"active\" cats, a list of available reading nooks, and a calendar for booking 1-hour sessions.\n\nUse a warm \"parchment\" colored background with soft brown text and rounded, bubble-like buttons that look like cat paws to create a friendly, cutesy feel.\n\nIf the \"Cat-O-Meter\" shows all cats are napping, the app should display a \"Shhh... Nap Time\" banner and suggest booking a later slot for more interaction. If all the reading nooks are booked, the app should show the next available time slot.",
            "lineHeight": 1.25,
            "baseline": 527
          },
