    "display_name": "The Cozy Nook",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Jada needs a booking system for her cat cafe and bookstore.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/71568ca9a6613b89c3200330a2434dee-Screenshot 2026-03-04 at 1.43.09 PM.png",
    "teacher_markdown": "Have students read over their prompt to \"see\" their web app in their mind. \r\n\r\nIf their requirements are too vague for them to visualize the webpage, encourage them to add at least one more specific detail to each category. \r\n\r\nThe more detailed and specific their prompt, the more likely AI is to build exactly what they are envisioning."
